# Product decisions

Follow `docs/PRODUCT_DECISIONS.md`. Summary:

## MVP-1 do not build
- Public ratings/reviews
- Multi-day / week discount engine
- Cook platform surcharge (% or per-order fee)
- Shadowfax / IVR

## Monetization
- Customer platform fee ₹7 once per checkout (not per day on week cart); cook gets 100% of food at launch
- Do not add cook-side fees without an explicit ask after supply is healthy
- LIVE cooks need FSSAI + payout UPI/bank note (Route optional while RBI-blocked); Admin Mark paid for EOD

## Reviews (when building MVP-2)
- Platform-standard for LIVE kitchens — not cook opt-in
- Only after completed paid order; cook may reply, not hide reviews

## Week discounts (when building later)
- Cook-controlled optional % for N+ days; no coupon stacks; keep simple
